    45	#     - to make D12 visible, generation always includes >= 1 "near miss" kept component that shows all 3
    46	#       legend colors while failing the repetition test
    47	#     - other kept components may miss colors entirely, which provides contrast without adding extra rule branches
    48	#   implicit_assumptions_from_original_main:
