    50	#     - components_mask(g != bg, connectivity=4) must stay unchanged so color 0 still glues a rectangle together
    51	#     - the original line collecting {g[r,c] for pts} is no longer valid because singleton target pixels would
    52	#       incorrectly count; it is replaced with a scan-order repeated-color extractor
